    "prompts/task-conventions.md": "# Task conventions\n\n- The board lives in `tasks/board.kanban.yaml` (columns Todo / Doing / Done); the backlog in `tasks/backlog.table.yaml`.\n- When you finish work, move its card and update `status` in the backlog row.\n- Keep card texts short; details go in the backlog row.\n"
  },
  "pin": [
    "prompts/task-conventions.md"
  ]
